  "briefing": {
    "title": "AFTERSHOCK",
    "story": [
      "The charges have spoken. Whatever the Warden chose at the First Vein, Aether",
      "Prime is a different world for it — and the Directorate has not surrendered.",
      "Director Halex's surviving flights are massing on the ridge above the wound,",
      "and something in the deep sand has changed its rhythm.",
      "",
      "SERA VANE: \"We won the argument. Now we survive the answer. Dig in on the",
      "vein, Warden. Corr's armour holds the north gate — everyone else, on me.\""
    ],
    "objectives": [
      "Hold the line at the First Vein until the alliance regroups (5:30)"
    ]
  },
  "debrief": {
    "win": [
      "The ridge falls silent. The alliance holds the wound of the world — bloodied,",
      "unbroken, and no longer anyone's dog. Halex's command still burns on the far",
      "horizon. One reckoning left.",
      "VANE: \"Rest an hour, Warden. Then we go and end the man who started all of it.\""
    ],
    "lose": [
      "The line breaks over the First Vein. The aftershock swallows the alliance whole,",
      "and the Directorate writes the history that survives."
    ]
  },
